---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';

const lang = 'en' as const;
---

<Base
  lang={lang}
  title="Terms of Service | Breezer"
  description="Terms of service and end user licence agreement for the Breezer snus app."
  path="/eula"
  noindex
>
  <Header lang={lang} />
  <main class="pt-[120px] pb-16">
    <div class="dark:text-white">

        <div class="container mx-auto p-6 pt-[100px] bg-white dark:bg-stroke-dark rounded-lg shadow-md">
          <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 dark:text-white mb-6">End-User License Agreement</h1>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 mb-8"><strong>Last updated: 14.08.2026</strong></p>

          <p class="mb-4">These terms and conditions ("Terms", "Agreement") are an agreement between Breezer ("Breezer", "we", "us", or "our") and you ("User", "you", or "your"). This Agreement sets forth the general terms and conditions of your use of the Breezer mobile application and its services (collectively, the "App", "Mobile Application", or "Services").</p>

          <p class="mb-4">By accessing or using the Services, you agree to be bound by these Terms and all applicable laws and regulations. If you do not agree with any of these Terms, you are prohibited from using or accessing the Services. Please read this Agreement carefully before using the Services.</p>

          <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-gray-900 dark:text-white mb-4">1. Scope of Service</h2>
          <p class="mb-4">This Agreement applies only to your use of the Breezer App and Services. Breezer provides tools to track your snus consumption, set personalized limits, analyze usage patterns, use a quitting mode (with derived achievements), participate in global and country channels with mentions, share images in community chat (available to Pro subscribers), and connect with friends to share progress and receive notifications. The App relies on user-provided data and does not include any sensors, medical advice, or external monitoring services.</p>

          <p class="mb-4">You agree to use the Services in compliance with this Agreement and all applicable laws. Breezer is not responsible for user-provided data, including its accuracy, completeness, or implications.</p>

          <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-gray-900 dark:text-white mb-4">2. Disclaimer: No Medical Advice</h2>
          <p class="mb-4">Breezer is not a healthcare provider, and the Services are not intended to diagnose, treat, cure, or prevent any medical condition. All data and insights provided by the App are for informational and tracking purposes only. Any displayed health improvements or milestones are estimates based on third-party studies and may be inaccurate. You should consult a qualified healthcare provider for any medical concerns or advice related to your snus consumption or general health.</p>

          <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-gray-900 dark:text-white mb-4">3. User Responsibility</h2>
          <p class="mb-4">You are solely responsible for:</p>
          <ul class="list-disc pl-6 mb-4">
              <li>Accurately entering your snus consumption and quitting data into the App.</li>
              <li>Setting appropriate personal limits within the App.</li>
              <li>Using the insights, statistics, achievements, and motivational content responsibly.</li>
              <li>Maintaining respectful conduct in community features (global chat, country channels, mentions).</li>
          </ul>

          <p class="mb-4">Breezer is not liable for any health issues, financial implications, or other outcomes resulting from your use of the Services or decisions based on the data you input or the insights provided by the App.</p>

          <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-gray-900 dark:text-white mb-4">4. Account Management and Security</h2>
          <p class="mb-4">By creating an account with Breezer, you represent and warrant the following:</p>
          <ul class="list-disc pl-6 mb-4">
              <li>You are at least 18 years old.</li>
              <li>You have provided accurate and complete registration information.</li>
              <li>You will maintain the confidentiality of your account credentials.</li>
          </ul>

          <p class="mb-4">You are responsible for all activities that occur under your account. If you suspect unauthorized use, you must notify us immediately at <a href="mailto:info@breezer.now" class="text-blue-500 underline">info@breezer.now</a>. Breezer will not be liable for any loss or damage arising from your failure to secure your account.</p>

          <p class="mb-4">The following actions are strictly prohibited:</p>
          <ul class="list-disc pl-6 mb-4">
              <li>Sharing your account credentials with others.</li>
              <li>Using another user's account without permission.</li>
              <li>Exploiting the App’s features for unauthorized or illegal purposes.</li>
          </ul>

          <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-gray-900 dark:text-white mb-4">5. Privacy Policy App</h2>
          <p class="mb-4">Your use of the Services is governed by our Privacy Policy App. By using the App, you consent to the collection, use, and sharing of your information as described in the Privacy Policy App, including processing for community features and push notifications. You can manage notification preferences in Settings at any time.</p>

          <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-gray-900 dark:text-white mb-4">6. Intellectual Property</h2>
          <p class="mb-4">All content, features, and functionality available through the Services are owned by Breezer and protected by applicable copyright, trademark, and other intellectual property laws. We grant you a limited, non-exclusive, non-transferable, revocable license to access and use the App for personal, non-commercial purposes.</p>

          <p class="mb-4">You agree not to:</p>
          <ul class="list-disc pl-6 mb-4">
              <li>Copy, modify, or distribute any part of the App or its content without prior written consent from Breezer.</li>
              <li>Reverse-engineer, decompile, or create derivative works based on the App.</li>
              <li>Use the App for commercial purposes without authorization.</li>
          </ul>

          <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-gray-900 dark:text-white mb-4">7. Community Conduct and Moderation</h2>
          <p class="mb-4">You agree not to post content that is unlawful, harmful, harassing, hateful, abusive, defamatory, obscene, or otherwise objectionable. You must not impersonate others, disclose others personal information without consent, or engage in spam or illegal activity. We may, but are not obligated to, monitor, review, remove, or restrict content or accounts at our sole discretion to keep the community safe. You can report or block users in the App. This includes images shared in community chat. You are solely responsible for any images you upload and must not share images that are unlawful, explicit, harmful, or infringe third-party rights.</p>

          <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-gray-900 dark:text-white mb-4">8. Automated Activity Announcements</h2>
          <p class="mb-4">The app may automatically post messages in community chat on your behalf when you reach certain milestones (e.g. snus count, clean days) or change your usage mode (e.g. switching to quitting). These messages display your username and are visible to other users in the same channel. If you wish to have a specific announcement removed, contact <a href="mailto:info@breezer.now" class="text-blue-500 underline">info@breezer.now</a>.</p>

          <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-gray-900 dark:text-white mb-4">9. Modification of Terms</h2>
          <p class="mb-4">Breezer reserves the right to modify, update, or replace these Terms at any time. Changes will be effective immediately upon posting. It is your responsibility to review this Agreement periodically. Continued use of the Services after changes have been made constitutes your acceptance of the revised Terms.</p>

          <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-gray-900 dark:text-white mb-4">10. Limitation of Liability</h2>
          <p class="mb-4">The Services are provided "as is" and "as available" without any warranties, express or implied. Breezer disclaims all warranties, including but not limited to merchantability, fitness for a particular purpose, and non-infringement.</p>

          <p class="mb-4">To the maximum extent permitted by law, Breezer shall not be liable for any direct, indirect, incidental, consequential, or punitive damages arising from your use of the Services, including but not limited to:</p>
          <ul class="list-disc pl-6 mb-4">
              <li>Health issues or outcomes related to snus consumption.</li>
              <li>Errors or inaccuracies in the data or insights provided by the App, including quitting mode milestones.</li>
              <li>Unauthorized access to your account or data.</li>
              <li>User-generated content in chats or channels, including mentions.</li>
          </ul>

          <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-gray-900 dark:text-white mb-4">11. Indemnification</h2>
          <p class="mb-4">You agree to indemnify and hold harmless Breezer, its affiliates, employees, officers, and agents from any claims, damages, losses, or expenses (including reasonable legal fees) arising out of your:</p>
          <ul class="list-disc pl-6 mb-4">
              <li>Violation of this Agreement.</li>
              <li>Use of the Services.</li>
              <li>Misuse or unauthorized use of the App.</li>
          </ul>

          <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-gray-900 dark:text-white mb-4">12. Termination of Service</h2>
          <p class="mb-4">Breezer reserves the right to suspend or terminate your account or access to the Services at any time, for any reason, including but not limited to:</p>
          <ul class="list-disc pl-6 mb-4">
              <li>Violation of this Agreement.</li>
              <li>Unauthorized or harmful behavior, including violations of community conduct.</li>
          </ul>

          <p class="mb-4">Upon termination, your right to use the Services will immediately cease. Sections 2, 6, 10, and 11 of this Agreement will survive termination.</p>

          <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-gray-900 dark:text-white mb-4">13. Governing Law</h2>
          <p class="mb-4">This Agreement shall be governed by and construed in accordance with the laws of Austria, without regard to its conflict of law provisions. Any disputes arising from or relating to this Agreement will be subject to the exclusive jurisdiction of the courts in Austria.</p>

          <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-gray-900 dark:text-white mb-4">14. Contact Information</h2>
          <p class="mb-4">For any questions, concerns, reports, or feedback regarding this Agreement or the Services (including moderation issues), you can contact us at:</p>
          <p class="mb-4"><strong>Email:</strong> <a href="mailto:info@breezer.now" class="text-blue-500 underline">info@breezer.now</a></p>

          <p class="mt-6 text-center text-sm text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400">Thank you for using Breezer. We’re excited to help you take control of your snus consumption and support your journey to a healthier lifestyle.</p>

      </div>
  </main>
  <Footer lang={lang} />
</Base>
